        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mary Soames, Clementine Churchill, Winston Churchill\n- Roles: Baroness Soames, Baroness Spencer-Churchill, life peer\n- Family: Churchill family\n\nFacts:\n- Clementine Ogilvy Spencer-Churchill, Baroness Spencer-Churchill, née Hozier, was born on 1 April 1885 and died on 12 December 1977.\n- Clementine Churchill was the wife of Sir Winston Churchill and a life peer in her own right.\n- Mary Soames, Baroness Soames, née Spencer-Churchill, was born on 15 September 1922 and died on 31 May 2014.\n- Mary Soames was the youngest of the five children of Winston Churchill and his wife, Clementine.",
